+
+Two things a reader will otherwise learn by surprise: a MEMREF_OUTPUT comes
+back with the size that went in, because QSEECOM gives the kernel no response
+length to report; and a listener that cannot be withdrawn is leaked on purpose,
+which pins the context and blocks a later rmmod.
+
+Reported-by: Kimi K3
